This is a static web page that decodes, validates and builds CBOR documents
carrying metrological values, CBOR tag 44252, as defined in the specification
"CBOR Tag 44252: Metrological Values" by Achim Friedland, GraphDefined GmbH.

Unlike the libraries it is built on, the built page does bundle third-party
code: dist/validator.js contains @vanaheimr/metrological-cbor and
@vanaheimr/cose (Apache-2.0, GraphDefined GmbH) and the @noble/curves,
@noble/hashes, @noble/ciphers and @noble/post-quantum packages (MIT, Paul
Miller; @noble/ciphers also Thomas Pornin). Since the page is deployed as
those three files and nothing else, the copyright notices and licence texts
these packages require are generated into the head of dist/validator.js at
build time, from the LICENSE and NOTICE files of exactly the packages that
were bundled.
